{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Allure|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Evelynn
|skill        = W
|icon         = Allure.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Evelynn}} ''curses'' the target enemy, causing her next {{tip|basic attack}} or {{tip|ability}} against the target to ''expunge'' the ''curse'', {{tip|slow|slowing}} the target and refunding the {{sti|mana|{{as|mana cost}}}}.
|blurb2       = If the ''curse'' matures long enough, the ''expunge'' will increase the slow, {{tip|charm}} the target, and apply an additional effect based on the target type.
* {{tip|Champions}} have {{sti|magic penetration|{{as|reduced magic resist}}}} for a few seconds.
* {{tip|Monsters}} are dealt {{as|'''bonus''' magic damage}} and increased {{tip|charm}} duration.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Evelynn''' ''curses'' the target enemy {{tip|champion}} or medium or large {{tip|monster}} for 5 seconds.
|description2 = '''Evelynn's''' next {{tip|basic attack}} or {{tip|ability}} against the ''accursed'' target ''expunges'' them, {{tip|slow|slowing}} them by 45% for {{fd|0.75}} seconds.
|description3 = ''Expunging'' a target will refund ''Allure's'' {{as|{{sti|mana|mana cost}}}}. If the target is ''cursed'' for at least {{fd|2.5}} seconds, the ''expunge'' also {{tip|charm|charms}} them for a few seconds and the duration of the {{tip|slow}} is increased to last for this time, as well as applying additional effects based on the target type.
|leveling3    = {{st|Disable Duration|{{ap|1.25 to 2.25}} seconds}}
|description4 = Against champions, the ''expunge'' also inflicts {{sti|magic penetration|{{as|magic resistance reduction}}}} for 4 seconds.
|leveling4    = {{st|Magic Resistance Reduction|{{as|{{ap|35 to 45}}%|magic resistance}}}}
|description5 = Against monsters, the ''expunge'' deals {{as|'''bonus''' magic damage}} and increases the duration of the {{tip|charm}} by 2 seconds.
|leveling5    = {{st|Bonus Magic Damage|{{ap|250 to 450}} {{as|(+ 60% AP)}}}}
{{st|Monster Disable Duration|{{ap|1.25+2 to 2.25+2}} seconds}}
|description6 = ''Casting Allure does not break {{ai|Demon Shade|Evelynn}} nor its fade into it.''
|cooldown     = {{ap|15 to 11}}
|cdstart      = on-cast
|cost         = {{ap|60 to 100}}
|cast time    = {{fd|0.25}}
|costtype     = Mana
|target range = {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{ap|1200 to 1600}}
|targeting    = Unit
|affects      = Enemies
|damagetype   = Magic
|spellshield  = Special
|spelleffects = Single target
|occurrence   = On-hit
|projectile   = 
|notes        = 
* The mark fully forming signifies the {{fd|2.5}} seconds have elapsed, meaning the {{tip|charm}} will be applied on the triggering attack or ability.
** An enemy champion cursed by ''Allure'' is alarmed of her presence and after the mark has fully formed, an arrow will appear next to them pointing towards '''Evelynn's''' direction. This is visible to both teams.
* The {{sti|magic penetration|{{as|magic resistance reduction}}}} will be applied to the attack or ability that triggers it.
* ''Allure's'' mark application on a target cannot be blocked by {{tip|spell shield}}.
** The expunge will not occur if the ability is blocked by a spell shield. The mark does not trigger and will remain on the target in this case.
* The {{sti|magic penetration|{{as|magic resistance reduction}}}} debuff is applied independently of the {{tip|Charm}} debuff when the matured mark is expunged, meaning a target can still have their magic resistance reduced while they are resisting applications of CC debuffs (e.g. {{cai|Black Shield|Morgana}}).
* If the target becomes {{tip|untargetable}}, {{tip|death|dies}}, or is too far away or no longer in {{tip|sight}} during the cast time, this ability will cancel but still go on {{sti|cooldown}} and pay its cost.{{bug}}
** ''Allure'' will restart its cooldown whenever the mark debuff is removed.{{bug}}
|yvideo       = eui_NQ_ZZUo
|flavorsound  = {{sm2|Evelynn_Original_W_6.ogg|}} ''"Go on, touch me."''
}}

